      "mergeID": "637e9f8472d9427f35c1494d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I have a number of avatars that would be greatly improved if they could have an item or a gesture on their avatar that changes how their voice is processed, like pulling out a megaphone or a muffle from putting on a helmet. This would get toggled with the \"avatar sounds\" option in the safety settings.",
