      "value": "@{59b5b70d090dc0367f77ce82|full_name}: That is a weirdly angry tone to be striking right now. It sounds like you're saying, on the >feature suggestion< canny for vrchat no less, that we should be grateful for what we've got and should stop asking for things. \n\nIf it's impossible then it's impossible but there's no reason to be mad at me or anyone else about that. I just want my voice to sound muffled when I put on a helmet without having to take my headset off to fiddle with a modulation software every single time I want to do a gesture.",
