      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Now that Rec Room is shutting down in about 9 days as of writing this, people may come to VRChat as an alternative. It might be a good as ever time to consider adding this. Not as an avatar feature, but part of the voice settings and built into VRChat.",
